<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Paging Study Lab</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif; margin: 40px; line-height: 1.5; background: #f6f8fb; color: #1e293b; }
        main { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px; }
        .card { background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08); }
        .label { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2563eb; font-weight: 700; }
        a { color: #0f172a; }
        .actions { margin-top: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <h1>Paging Study Lab</h1>
    <p>노션 예제 `(0) ~ (6)`를 실행 가능한 Spring Boot 프로젝트로 재구성했다.</p>
    <p>브랜치를 이동하거나 현재 `main`에서 각 URL을 열어 단계별 결과를 확인할 수 있다.</p>

    <section class="grid">
        {{#steps}}
            <article class="card">
                <div class="label">{{label}}</div>
                <h2>{{title}}</h2>
                <p>{{summary}}</p>
                <div class="actions">
                    <a href="{{path}}">열기</a>
                </div>
            </article>
        {{/steps}}
    </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
